Subject: [PATCH] test(dsv41): trace sparse attention boundary

Capture index-query bytes, head weights, candidate blocks, selected sparse keys, metadata, and attention outputs at the target position. This diagnostic commit is newly implemented and AI-assisted on top of the imported Christopher Owen/vLLM build baseline; it is not a claim of upstream authorship.
